# The build context of the API image (apps/api/Dockerfile, built from the repository root) is an
# allowlist: the workspace manifests and the packages the API is built from. Environment files,
# private notes (.context/), worktrees, scratch files and build output never enter an image.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/api/
!packages/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.turbo/
**/.env
**/.env.*
